{"title":"2017 AIME I","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2017 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Invitational_Mathematics_Examination\" title=\"American Invitational Mathematics Examination\">AIME</a> I</b> problems and solutions. The test was held on Tuesday, March 7, 2017. The first link contains the full set of test problems. The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems\">Entire Test</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\